{
  "slug": "pigment",
  "name": "Pigment",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Analyze business data and build custom Pigment models, metrics, and boards through natural language.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `analyzing-pigment-data` (Always use this skill when querying, exploring, or analyzing existing data in a Pigment workspace), `building-pigment-frames` (How to build Pigment Frames, custom full-page JavaScript visualisations that read Pigment data through the PigmentSDK inside a…), `designing-boards` (Always use when creating or editing a Board), `designing-views` (Always use this skill when creating, editing, or needing to pick a View - including chart type and…), `formatting-and-highlighting` (Best practices for metric default formatting), `integrating-pigment-data` (Use this skill when integrating external data into Pigment - importing an attached CSV file, deciding whether to…), `modeling-pigment-applications` (Always use this skill when designing or modifying Pigment applications), `optimizing-pigment-performance` (Always use this skill when troubleshooting slow calculations or timeouts, analyzing profiler output to identify bottlenecks, understanding scope…), and 4 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `pigment`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pigment@claude-plugins-official` from `gopigment/ai-plugins`.",
